{% block content %}
<section class="quiz-hero">
<div class="quiz-hero-text">
<p class="eyebrow">Athanas Inspires Tools</p>
<h1>General ICT Quiz Game</h1>
<p>Practice computer basics, Word, Excel, internet safety, and everyday ICT skills in the Athanas Inspires spirit: clear explanations, courage for beginners, and learning that moves you from confusion to clarity.</p>
<div class="quiz-hero-actions">
<a class="btn" href="#quizApp">Start Quiz</a>
<a class="btn secondary-btn" href="index.html">Back to Tools</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<main class="quiz-page" id="main-content">
<section aria-label="Athanas Inspires General ICT Quiz Game" class="quiz-app-card">
<div class="quiz-topbar">
<div>
<p class="calc-mini-title">Practice Zone</p>
<h2>Choose a Quiz Category</h2>
</div>
<div class="quiz-score-pill" id="bestScorePill">Best: 0%</div>
</div>
<div aria-label="Quiz categories" class="quiz-category-tabs" id="categoryTabs">
<button class="category-tab active" data-category="All" type="button">All Topics</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Computer Basics" type="button">Computer Basics</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Microsoft Word" type="button">Word</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Microsoft Excel" type="button">Excel</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Internet &amp; Safety" type="button">Internet &amp; Safety</button>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-grid">
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Question</span>
<strong id="questionCounter">1 / 1</strong>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Score</span>
<strong id="scoreCounter">0</strong>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Category</span>
<strong id="categoryName">All Topics</strong>
</div>
</div>
<div class="athanas-tool-note">
<strong>Coach Athanas:</strong> Do not fear wrong answers. A wrong answer is just a teacher wearing a small disguise. Learn, repeat, and rise.
        </div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="quiz-progress">
<div class="quiz-progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>
</div>
<article class="question-card">
<div class="question-tag" id="questionTag">ICT</div>
<h3 id="questionText">Loading question...</h3>
<div class="answer-grid" id="answerGrid"></div>
<div aria-live="polite" class="feedback-box" id="feedbackBox"></div>
</article>
<div class="quiz-actions">
<button class="btn outline-btn quiz-control" id="restartQuiz" type="button">Restart Quiz</button>
<button class="btn quiz-control" id="nextQuestion" type="button">Next Question</button>
</div>
</section>
<aside class="quiz-side-panel">
<div class="side-card quiz-result-card" id="resultCard">
<h3>Your Quiz Result</h3>
<p id="resultSummary">Answer the questions and your final result will appear here.</p>
<div class="result-score-circle" id="resultCircle">0%</div>
<a class="small-btn" href="../courses.html">Watch ICT Lessons</a>
<a class="small-btn submit-btn" href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/Fd9rDqOyxRrKUctGqfevmt" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Join WhatsApp Community</a>
<button class="small-btn outline-btn share-score-btn" id="shareScore" type="button">Share My Score</button>
</div>
<div class="side-card learning-card athanas-identity-card">
<h3>Athanas Inspires Style</h3>
<ul>
<li>Beginner-friendly ICT practice.</li>
<li>Instant correction with encouragement.</li>
<li>Practical learning connected to real lessons.</li>
<li>Learn. Believe. Grow. Build.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="side-card learning-card">
<h3>How to Play</h3>
<ul>
<li>Choose a topic or use <strong>All Topics</strong>.</li>
<li>Read each question carefully before selecting an answer.</li>
<li>Learn from the explanation after every answer.</li>
<li>Restart anytime and try to beat your best score.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</aside>
</main>
{% endblock %}

